title: "A rank-three reduction for five-point quartic energy"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Proves that the worst minimal weighted quartic energy of a five-point spherical code of minimum angle sixty degrees is already attained in ambient dimension three. It does not evaluate the remaining three-dimensional optimum or the six- and seven-dimensional kissing numbers."
